-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("es",315,{
[10049]="700088CA\n1\tDefeat Tyrant Gundzor and claim the Grimwood Lumber-yard. You must not be defeated when the Tyrant falls\tThe Grimwood Lumber-yard lay near the centre of Hithlad. Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor asked you to find and defeat the troll-tyrant Gundzor at the Grimwood Lumber-yard.\n2\tHabla con Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor\tSergeant-at-Arms Hafthor awaits news of your victory over the Tyrant Gundzor at Glân Vraig. You met the Tyrant Gundzor within the lumber-yard and defeated him and his forces, taking the yard back for the Free Peoples. You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Hafthor with the news.\n",
[10050]="700088C6\n1\tDefeat Tyrant Tharbil and claim Lugazag. You must not be defeated when the tyrant falls\tLugazag looks east out over the Hoardale River. Once Lugazag was a great tower, part of the Rhudauran kingdom. Now, in the corrupt lands of the Steps of Gram, the tower stands as a location controlled by the Ongbúrz tribe and their Tyrant, Tharbil. Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten at Glân Vraig directed you to seek out and defeat the Tyrant Tharbil who holds command at Lugazag.\n2\tSpeak with Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten at Glân Vraig\tSergeant-at-Arms Hesten awaits your return at Glân Vraig. You defeated Tyrant Tharbil with the help of others to reclaim Tírith Rhaw. You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Hesten and tell him of your victory over Tharbil.\n",
[10051]="700088C8\n1\tDefeat Tyrant Trintrû and reclaim Tol Ascarnen. You must not be defeated when the tyrant falls\tTol Ascarnen, once the citadel responsible for the manufacture and storage of Rhudauran weapons and armour, lay to the north and west of Glân Vraig. Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent directed you to kill Tyrant Trintrû at Tol Ascarnen.\n2\tSpeak with Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent at Glân Vraig\tSergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent awaits your return at Glân Vraig. Facing down the enemy, you destroyed the Tyrant at Tol Ascarnen. You should return to Sergeant-at-Arms Thurimbent with the news.\n",
[10052]="70008B85\n1\tDerrota a Shadow-brood Hatchling (total: 100)\tLas cavernas bajo Helegrod están llenas de grietas y hendiduras, hogar de las crías de Zaudru. Atli Matararañas te ha pedido que mates tantas crías de la prole de la Sombra como puedas encontrar bajo Helegrod.\n",
[10053]="70067F81\n1\tDefeat raiding Corsairs in their camp ([según el diario]/10)\tElder Roshat asks that you deal with Jerath and his raiders. Their camp can be found along the road west of Khûtra.\n2\tReturn to Elder Roshat in Khûtra\030Collect Jerath's cutlass\tDefeat Jerath in the raider camp and retrieve his cutlass. Then return to Elder Roshat in Khûtra.\n",
[10054]="7005A9A0\n1\tDefeat Gundabad raid-leaders (total: 5)\030Collect dwarf-made weapons (total: 5)\tGundabad raiding parties can be found in Máttugard. You should defeat Gundabad raid-leaders and collect dwarf-made weapons.\n2\tBring the dwarf-made weapons to Lóssi\tLóssi can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu in Máttugard. You should bring the dwarf-made weapons to Lóssi.\n",
[10055]="70052B23\n1\tDefeat Shapag-hai in Woodsedge (total: 14)\tShapag-hai can be found at Fil Sulmog and wandering northern Woodsedge. Many of the Shapag-hai that remain in Woodsedge have gathered at Fil Sulmog. From the safety of their encampment, they launch raids against passing traders and unwary travellers. You should defeat them before they bring more harm to the people of the Vales.\n2\tCompletado\tYou have defeated many of the Shapag-hai at Fil Sulmog.\n",
[10056]="70025A2F\n1\tInvestiga las ruinas\tBarad Tharsír se encuentra al sureste del Coloso, en el Barandalf, al otro lado del Brandivino. Adleithian te ha pedido que encuentres una habitación oculta en las ruinas de Barad Tharsír y descubras qué hay dentro. Si algo te molesta, debe ser eliminado.\n2\tHabla con Adleithian\tAdleithian está en el campamento de Montaraces en el Coloso, al noroeste del Barandalf y al oeste de Parth Aduial. Adleithian está esperando escuchar lo que has encontrado en la sala de objetos confiscados.\n",
[10057]="70062E84\n1\tDerrota asaltantes bandidos en el Camino Verde (total: 8)\tAsaltantes bandidos causan problemas en el Camino Verde donde pasa hacia las Tierras de Bree.\n2\tHabla con el Maestro Buencorazón al sureste de las Ruinas de la Guardia del Sur\tMaestro Buencorazón está al sudeste de las Ruinas de Guardia del Sur.\n",
[10058]="700270FF\n1\tDerrota a las abominaciones orcas (total: 10)\tLas Abominaciones atacan Lhan Rhos desde el norte. Déin el anciano te ha pedido que detengas las invasiones de las Abominaciones.\n2\tHabla con Anurin en el Pantano Bruno\tAnurin está en el frente norte de los Avanc-lûth. 'Déin el Anciano te ha pedido que hables con Anurin una vez que hayas derrotado las oleadas de Abominaciones orcas.\n",
[10059]="70027B11\n1\tEncuentra el puesto de guardia junto a la puerta sur y toma buena comida\tLa despensa más grande está dentro del puesto de guardia, al subir una escalera corta en el punto más al sur del muro circular, justo junto a la entrada de Isengard. El lacayo de Morflak quiere que tomes algo de la buena comida del puesto de guardia y se la lleves a Morflak, al noroeste de la entrada sur y al suroeste de Orthanc.\n2\tHabla con Morflak\tHas entregado la comida a Morflak y deberías hablar con él.\n3\tHabla con el lacayo de Morflak\tEl lacayo de Morflak está muy satisfecho con tu entrega de comida a Morflak.\n",
[10060]="70037BEF\n1\tDefeat Dunlending archer-captains (0/2) Defeat Dunlending archers (0/4)\tArcher formations have been spotted patrolling the perimeter around Brockbridge. They should be dealt with.\n2\tDefeat Dunlending archer-captains (total: 2)\030Defeat Dunlending archers (total: 4)\tArcher formations have been spotted patrolling the perimeter around Brockbridge. They should be dealt with.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have dealt with many of the archer formations patrolling the perimeter around Brockbridge.\n",
[10061]="7004410F\n1\tShroud the heads of the fallen before hope is lost\tThe severed heads of numerous slain Gondorians have been hurled over the walls of Minas Tirith. The warriors and inhabitants of Gondor alike shall soon fall to despair unless the Enemy's vile design is undone.\n",
[10062]="700442CC\n1\tShroud the heads of the fallen before hope is lost\tThe severed heads of numerous slain Gondorians have been hurled over the walls of Minas Tirith. The warriors and inhabitants of Gondor alike shall soon fall to despair unless the Enemy's vile design is undone.\n",
[10063]="7004DA71\n1\tCollect the stack of notices in the guards' barracks\tThe stack of notices is in the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should collect the stack of notices.\n2\tPost notices in Lake-town (total: 10)\tNotices can be posted in places all around Lake-town. You should post notices around Lake-town.\n3\tTalk to Álarr\tCaptain Álarr can be found in the Guards' Barracks in Lake-town. You should return to Álarr and inform him that the notices are posted.\n",
[10064]="700668D7\n1\tTalk to Varbris\tNordach has sent you on to Ritherstad in search of Varbris. Ritherstad is in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n2\tSlap Brúlen's rump\tVarbris has asked you to slap the rumps of his cows and shoo them away from the farm so that they might not fall prey to the goblins. You should slap cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n3\tSlap Alo's rump\tYou have slapped one cow rump, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping. You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n4\tSlap Elester's rump\tYou have slapped two cow rumps, but there are yet more rumps that need slapping. You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n5\tSlap Griga's rump\tYour hand stings and you have stepped in something squishy and yet - there remain still more rumps that need slapping! You should slap more cow rumps at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n6\tSlap Glúsi's rump\tYou have slapped enough cow rumps to consider it a new profession of yours, but one rump yet remains unslapped! You should slap one more cow rump at Ritherstad, in northern Pinnath Gelin.\n7\tReturn to Varbris\tYou have successfully driven off the cows of Ritherstad. You should let Varbris know his beloved girls are safe from goblins for the moment. Varbris is at Ritherstad.\n",
[10065]="7006F089\n1\tGather tent supplies (total: 5)\tSângal is worried that the displaced people in Iridír have no place to sleep. You can gather supplies nearby to help construct the tents.\n2\tConstruct tents (total: 3)\tHelp Sângal set up tents for the displaced people in Iridír.\n3\tReturn to Sângal\tReturn to Sângal in Iridír and let him know you have finished setting up the tents for the displaced people to use. They no longer have to sleep in the open weather and cold.\n",
[10066]="70000051\n1\tDerrota huargos en Nain Enidh (total: 10)\tSe pueden encontrar huargos en el Gran Camino del Este, en el extremo de Nain Enidh, cerca de Ost Cyrn. El Viejo Artemisa cree que si enfadas a suficientes huargos, llamarán a su líder.\n2\tHabla con el Viejo Artemisa\tEl Viejo Artemisa está en el campamento en el extremo este de Minas Eriol. Los huargos seguramente están enfadados ahora, dados tus logros en Nain Enidh, y el Viejo Artemisa debe ser informado de tu éxito.\n",
[10067]="700561E4\n1\tRastrilla las hojas (total: 6)\tSe pueden encontrar hojas esparcidas dentro de las residencias del Folde Este de Rohan. Debes rastrillar las hojas.\n",
[10068]="7000C38C\n1\tDerrota a Rakothúrz, Horm's Handler\030Derrota a Horm, The Pit Beast\tLa Ciudad de los Trasgos está al noreste del campamento de Glóin, y la sala del trono debería hallarse al final de los numerosos túneles. Tralli Buscagemas te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes al troll y al trasgo, Horm y Rakothúrz, en la sala del trono del Gran Trasgo.\n2\tHabla con Tralli Buscagemas\tTralli Buscagemas está en el campamento de Glóin, en las Montañas Nubladas, justo fuera de la entrada a la Ciudad de los Trasgos. Deberías volver con Tralli Buscagemas y contarle tu éxito.\n",
[10069]="70048C75\n1\tGather Drúedain villagers (total: 10)\tDrúedain villagers can be found in Bhol Rûdh. You should gather Drúedain villagers.\n2\tTalk to Ghai-buri-Sêk\tGhai-buri-Sêk can be found in the village Bhol Rûdh. You should talk to Ghai-buri-Sêk.\n",
[10070]="70017593\n1\tLevanta el ánimo de Eldur\030Levanta el ánimo de Lythur\030Levanta el ánimo de Skafti\tEldur puede encontrarse en la Bodega Putrefacta, justo al oeste de las Profundidades Llameantes. Lythur está en el Umbral de Durin, en el borde occidental de la Gran Excavación, al norte de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata. Skafti está en Jazârgund, en medio del Camino de Durin, en las zonas septentrionales de Moria. Garnyd te ha pedido que levantes el ánimo de tres soldados enanos dispersos por Moria: Eldur, Lythur y Skafti.\n2\tHabla con Garnyd en Anazârmekhem\tGarnyd se encuentra en Anazârmekhem, en las Profundidades Llameantes. Ahora que has levantado el ánimo de los enanos, es momento de regresar junto a Garnyd.\n",
[10071]="70041461\n1\tRepair damaged barricades (total: 6)\tBarricades can be found along the borders of Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Garvir has asked you to aid in repairing the defences of Linhir before the Corsairs and Haradrim can rally against the settlement once more.\n2\tWarriors of Linhir can be found outside Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. Garvir has asked you to rally warriors that fled when Aragorn and the Grey Host passed through Linhir.\t\n3\tTalk to Garvir\tGarvir can be found in Linhir in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have readied the defences of Linhir and rallied the frightened Men who abandoned their posts. You should now speak to Garvir.\n",
[10072]="7002F58A\n1\tLos posibles reclutas se pueden encontrar entre las murallas de la ciudad de Elthengels. Wuscrad te ha pedido que hables con los refugiados de Elthengels y los convenzas de ofrecerse voluntarios para unirse a la milicia.\t\n2\tRegresa con Wuscrad con noticias sobre los nuevos reclutas\tWuscrad se encuentra en el pueblo de Elthengels. Wuscrad espera noticias sobre los posibles reclutas para la milicia de Elthengels.\n3\tRecoge provisiones en las casas abandonadas al norte de Elthengels (total: 4)\tWuscrad habló de unas casas abandonadas justo al norte del pueblo de Elthengels, más allá de las puertas de la ciudad. El comandante de la guarnición de Elthengels te ha pedido que consigas provisiones de las casas cercanas que han sido abandonadas recientemente.\n4\tRegresa con Wuscrad con las provisiones\tWuscrad se encuentra en la localidad de Elthengels. Debes llevar las provisiones recuperadas a Wuscrad en Elthengels.\n",
[10073]="7005B4CF\n1\tTalk to Málur Keenword\tMálur is located in Bazanmanar. Mother Amma has asked you to see how far Málur Keenword has come in deciphering the journal.\n2\tPick up the translated journal\tThe journal is on the table beside Málur in Clovengap. You should pick up the translated journal.\n3\tBring the journal to Mother Amma\tMother Amma is in Bazanmanar. You should bring the translated journal to Mother Amma.\n",
[10074]="70007DD8\n1\tDerrota bestias de las nieves\tLas bestias de las nieves se encuentran en las Montañas Nubladas, especialmente cerca del nacimiento del Bruinen. Derrota bestias de las nieves donde quiera que las encuentres para hacer los pasos de montaña más seguros para los viajeros.\n2\tDerrota bestias de las nieves (total: 12)\tLas bestias de las nieves se encuentran en las Montañas Nubladas, especialmente cerca del nacimiento del Bruinen. Derrota bestias de las nieves donde quiera que las encuentres para hacer los pasos de montaña más seguros para los viajeros.\n3\tHabla con Malthenor\tMalthenor de Rivendel se ha instalado en las Montañas Nubladas para montar guardia en el campamento de Glóin. Malthenor está complacido de oír que has derrotado a muchas bestias de las nieves.\n",
[10075]="70038469\n1\tLook for the stable-hand\tThe stable-hand is in the field behind the stable. A guard saw a local stable-hand being followed by a rowdy group of men and has asked you to check on him.\n2\tTalk to the healer in Woodhurst\tThe healer is in the shop behind the inn that faces the fountain in the centre of Woodhurst. Broda asked you to seek help for him from the town healer.\n3\tBroda, the injured stable-hand, is in the field behind the stable by the eastern gate of Woodhurst. You should bring the healer's pack to Broda at once.\t\n4\tTalk to Broda\tBroda is in the field behind the stable. You should speak with Broda again, before moving on.\n",
[10076]="700097E0\n1\tRecupera la reliquia robada del cuerpo de un saqueador de tumbas\tUn grupo de saqueadores de tumbas tuvo un encontronazo con los osos de Nan Orngon, al este de Ost Forod en Tyrn Fornech. Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que encuentres los cuerpos de los saqueadores de tumbas de Nan Orngon y recuperes cualquier artefacto que pudieran haber robado.\n2\tLleva la estatuilla rota a Robin Sotopardo\tRobin Sotopardo está en Ost Forod, al oeste de Nan Orngon, en Tyrn Fornech. Has recuperado un fragmento de estatua antigua de un saqueador que tuvo algunos problemas con los osos de Nan Orngon. Robin Sotopardo te ha pedido que vuelvas con cualquier reliquia que encuentres a Ost Forod.\n",
[10077]="7000ABAE\n1\tPatrol the Ettenmoors for 60 minutes\tPatrol the Ettenmoors.\n",
[10078]="7000AC05\n1\tPatrol the Ettenmoors\tPatrol the Ettenmoors.\n",
[10079]="7000B104\n1\tPatrol the Ettenmoors\tPatrol the Ettenmoors.\n",
